      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "1. System should be able to collect heartbeats, metrics\n    and logs\n2. System should be able to generate alerts based on\n    conditions\n3. System should be able to visualize collected data ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. System should be able to collect heartbeats, metrics\n    and logs\n2. System should be able to generate alerts based on\n    conditions\n3. System should be able to visualize collected data ",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 119,
      "index": "a1",
