      "text": "Metric\n- type counter|gauge|histogram|log\n- labels map[string]string\n- value: one of int64|float64|string\n- timestamp: datetime\n\nname -> __name__ label\n\nAlert\n- name\n- condition\n- notify: []NotificationChannel",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
