      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "emit metrics\n1. metrics are batched in\nsdk (configurable)\n2. metrics are encoded\nwith some binary encoding like protobuf\n3. metrics are transported using a persistent\n    http2 connection\n4. metrics are emitted to the configured region\n5. regional endpoint is automatically resolved using\n    DNS. DNS will automatically point to failover\n    region if the region is down\n\n\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "emit metrics\n1. metrics are batched in\nsdk (configurable)\n2. metrics are encoded\nwith some binary encoding like protobuf\n3. metrics are transported using a persistent\n    http2 connection\n4. metrics are emitted to the configured region\n5. regional endpoint is automatically resolved using\n    DNS. DNS will automatically point to failover\n    region if the region is down\n\n\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 269,
      "index": "aH",
      "autoResize": true
    },
