      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "OLAP/Columnar database like clickhouse\nWAL + LSM Tree\n\nmetric = (labels, value, timestamp)\nmetric_name = labels[\"__name__\"]\n\nseries_id = hash(name, sorted(labels))\n\nmetrics table\nseries_id\ntimestamp\nvalue_int\nvalue_float\nvalue_str\ntype = int|float|string\n\nwe need to maintain indexs which map\nlabel -> series_id\n\nso that we know which series to scan for\nserving queries\n\n\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OLAP/Columnar database like clickhouse\nWAL + LSM Tree\n\nmetric = (labels, value, timestamp)\nmetric_name = labels[\"__name__\"]\n\nseries_id = hash(name, sorted(labels))\n\nmetrics table\nseries_id\ntimestamp\nvalue_int\nvalue_float\nvalue_str\ntype = int|float|string\n\nwe need to maintain indexs which map\nlabel -> series_id\n\nso that we know which series to scan for\nserving queries\n\n\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 594,
      "index": "av",
      "autoResize": true
    },
